ppy by tapping in time to the rhythm and filling the Thump-o-Meter. Make a mistake, and the meter will deplete!\n\nMake Some Noise\nEnjoy an excellent musical score as the Thumpies drum along!\n\nCrazy Critters\nMeet the Thumpies, a collection of fuzzy monsters who live to bounce! Each of the Thumpies has its own unique look, each one wilder than the last!\n\nFEATURES\n• Full Remake of the 2010 classic\n• 26 Thumpies to unlock (including previously unreleased Thumpies)\n• 17 Levels and 83 Stages to complete\n• All New Achievement System - challenge yourself to Platinum each stage!\n• New Assist Mode - get help mastering challenging songs\n\nFor more information, check out: https://www.bigbluebubble.com/home/games/thumpies/\n\nMake sure to check out My Singing Monsters to enjoy the franchise which Thumpies started, and to collect all of the new Thumpies Costumes available!", "sellerUrl": "https://www.bigbluebubble.com/home/games/thumpies/", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 5, "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "170416128", "formattedPrice": "￦7,700", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 1, "trackContentRating": "4+", "minimumOsVersion": "13.0", "bundleId": "com.bigbluebubble.thumpies2023", "averageUserRating": 5, "trackCensoredName": "My Singing Monsters Thumpies", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/my-singing-monsters-thumpies/id6477390745?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "userRatingCount": 1}]}